DHGM (DroneHub Georgia Map)
==============================

This product includes software developed as part of the DroneHub ecosystem.

Primary components
------------------

1. **DHGM application** — derivative of ATAK-CIV, with overlay customizations
   in `custom/overlay/` (Georgian strings, branding, permissions).

2. **dhgm-bridge** — Python MAVLink → CoT bridge (`bridge/`), independent
   component using pymavlink (LGPL-3.0-or-later).

Upstream — ATAK-CIV
-------------------

  Project:  Android Tactical Assault Kit — Civil (ATAK-CIV)
  Source:   https://github.com/deptofdefense/AndroidTacticalAssaultKit-CIV
  License:  GNU General Public License v3.0 (or later)
  Version:  pinned at tag 4.6.0.5 for DHGM builds (see `.github/workflows/build-dhgm.yml`)

ATAK-CIV bundles numerous third-party native libraries via `takthirdparty`
(GDAL, spatialite, assimp, openssl, and others). See upstream `atak/takthirdparty`
for component licenses.

DroneHub GCS (related project)
------------------------------

  MAVLink telemetry source for DHGM; not bundled in this APK.
  Repository: sibling project DroneHub-GCS (QGroundControl fork).

